        enabled by adding a Usage Sharing Element to the Pipeline, which the
        FiftyOnePipelineBuilder does when ShareUsage is true, its default.
        -->
        <ShareUsage>false</ShareUsage>
    </BuildParameters>
</PipelineOptions>
